    "catalogWarnings": [
      "Wealth Focus Flexi 5 is currently modeled as a supported V1 product. Accumulation charges, the cumulative life-event free-withdrawal pool, MIP-end surrender charges, regular/top-up routing, the documented bonuses, and reinvest-default distribution support are modeled, but the top-up-first regular-withdrawal facility and protection-side options remain informational only.",
